{"title":"2021 WSMO Team Round/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_WSMO_Team_Round/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65af420a6e2b903f5295dd8f65f321545f69e44d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCDE$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> is drawn outside of equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd222166def59a3315433877917a826de6488031.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> Regular hexagon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b15a8079281095d74ac43e92d9eab3bb1b3080.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEFGHI$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" /> is drawn outside of square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/4/114dfdeb750fe97be27665f65641e9fa1eae2504.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BCDE.$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" /> If the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1bf55dee68ba4123ca736e3b4b2121ffebc98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AED$\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> is 3, then the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/61986fb9aca15a3d9fa47a37f10e6cc396e2ed1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AGH$\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc2bdd79a4482760fe7aa99e1c17a738929672dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\sqrt{b}-c,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"21\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is not divisible by the square of any prime. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f83de90288e19082ad3e20ae97127495aba51430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_WSMO_Team_Round/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018064013\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1434/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26188:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018064013 and revision id 207292. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}